{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > A Forbidden Tale of Betrayal in a Dungeon NTR(BSS) RPG</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc94 A dungeon-crawler RPG where two childhood friends are gradually corrupted by an interloper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Over 160 CGs in total! Most NTR (netorare) scenes feature a rich structure with 2+ CGs for foreplay and main action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Seamless battles with no screen transitions! Stress-free design with auto-battle for immersive adventures!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Packed with user-friendly features prioritizing player comfort.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >G-Cup &amp; H-Cup! Voluptuous childhood friends in abundant, steamy scenes!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udd25 NTR scenes are meticulously crafted, covering foreplay to climax with intense detail!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad Diverse situations tailored to each character\u2019s personality, showcasing a variety of expressions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 Packed with spontaneous, naughty events in towns and dungeons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f Unlock special items in dungeons to access exclusive H-scenes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Three unique endings to experience!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 Each ending comes with its own exclusive H-scenes! Your choices shape the story\u2019s conclusion!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Specifications &amp; Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udff7\ufe0f <strong>Game Genre</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Childhood Friend NTR (BSS) RPG</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f <strong>CG &amp; H-Scene Details</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Base CGs: 50+</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddee Total CGs: 160+</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Screen Resolution: 1280x720</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f Voice: H-scenes include voice acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Female H-Characters: Two (only the interloper and protagonist as male roles, no mob males)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83e\uddf0 <strong>Convenient Systems</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Illustration Motion Feature: Adds dynamic realism to H-scenes!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Scenario Progress &amp; Conversation Jump</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u3000\u3000 Check conversation progress anytime via the message window\u2019s bottom-right corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u3000\u3000 Click the progress icon to jump to specific dialogues.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Full Scenario Skip</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u3000\u3000 Long-press the cancel key to skip entire scenarios at any time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Text Features:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u3000\u3000 Includes text skip, adjustable auto-mode speed, quick save/load, log history, ejaculation countdown, and temporary window removal.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Story Event Replay Mode:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u3000\u3000 Revisit read scenarios anytime from the home screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u3000\u3000 Untriggered story event conditions are clearly displayed.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0H-Event Replay Mode:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u3000\u3000 Revisit viewed H-scenes and CGs anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u3000\u3000 Option to unlock all unviewed events.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Character Portrait Appreciation Mode:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u3000\u3000 Customize and view favorite characters\u2019 portraits with options for expressions, outfits, backgrounds, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u3000\u3000 Edit text to display personalized messages.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Cheat Mode:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u3000\u3000 For players who find battles tedious, the following features are included:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u3000\u3000 Mark dungeons as cleared. <br>\u203b Additional features include \u201cAuto-Skip H-Scenes\u201d for story-focused players and \u201cSkip to H-Scene Illustrations\u201d for those eager to jump to H-scenes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Configuration Options:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u3000\u3000 Adjust battle speed, gamepad/controller settings, key bindings, sound, window colors, text speed, fonts, and more for a fully customizable experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915320?t=1767924539","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915320?t=1767924539","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915320/b6d3f1f26c25ce016592307b75e81642247229a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767924539","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915320/b6d3f1f26c25ce016592307b75e81642247229a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767924539","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game contains sexual content such as sexual acts and sexual violence, extreme violence, BDSM, and drug ab